      "notes": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "From: Accessible Travel \nSent: 16 January 2026 14:30\nTo: RMI Reservations \u003Csanitized\u002Bd1ec33f6@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Virgin Ref: 6997721 - THE CLUB BARBADOS RESORT \u0026 SPA - 2383801 - BURGESS / ROSE\n\nThe Club Barbados Resort \u0026 Spa\n\nRoom Requirements  - **** THIS IS NOT A NEW BOOKING ****\n\nOur Ref : 6997721  \n2383801 \n\nClient Names: \nROSE BURGESS\nJOSEPH BURGESS\n\nArrival Date: 29 MAY 2026\nDeparture: 12 JUN 2026\n\nRoom Reserved: 1X One Bedroom Pool Garden View Suite Garden View \nRequired:  Ruby has restricted mobility, please can you confirm a room allocation on the ground floor.\n \nKind Regards, \n\nJoanna Lovett\nAdvisor - Accessible Travel Services\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays",
          "displayName": "Joanna Lovett",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-16T14:30:50",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~1",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "VA ATS TEAM ADVISED \n\n********* ACCESSIBLE TRAVEL SERVICES BOOKING****************\nANY AMENDMENTS MUST BE NOTIFIED TO US\nFLIGHT/ TRANSFERS/ACCOMMODATION/ CANCELLATIONS \n************************************************************************",
          "displayName": "Joanna Lovett",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-16T14:31:08",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~2",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Virgin Ref: 6997721  - THE CLUB BARBADOS RESORT \u0026 SPA - 2383801 - BURGESS / ROSE\nRMI Reservations\u003Csanitized\u002Bd1ec33f6@example.com\u003E\n\u200B\nAccessible Travel\u200B\nHi Joanna\n\n \n\nWe have added notes onto the booking so the hotel team are aware when assigning the room. We cannot guarantee special requirements/requests.\n\n \n\nRegards Mark",
          "displayName": "Deborah Patterson",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-16T17:49:45",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~3",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "From: Nicola J Davis On Behalf Of Accessible Travel \u003Csanitized\u002B5930225f@example.com\u003E\nSent: 17 January 2026 13:46\nTo: \u0027sanitized\u002B41467aeb@example.com\u0027 \u003Csanitized\u002B41467aeb@example.com\u003E\nSubject: REF 6997721 29/05/2026 DW9UNP \n\nDear Mrs Martin\n\nThank you for booking your vacation with Virgin Atlantic Holidays and letting us know that you may benefit from a little extra assistance.  \n      \nI am pleased to advise that The Club Barbados Resort \u0026 Spa have requested you a One Bedroom Pool Garden View Suite Garden View on the ground floor.  Hotels can only ever provide a 98% guarantee in case of extenuating circumstances (i.e. rooms are out of order for any reason.) The hotel will provide you with the best room to fit your needs.    \nPlease see attached the amount of steps around The Club Barbados Resort \u0026 Spa, if you would like to look at an alternative hotel, please contact our service team on 0344 472 9646.      \n\nPrivate transfers have been booked for your arrival and departure; please make yourselves known to our representatives and they will escort you to your vehicle. \n\nI have forwarded your contact details onto Virgin Atlantic Accessible Travel Services, so that they can arrange any airport/on-board assistance needs. They are working through requests in travel date order and will be in touch a little closer to your departure date sanitized\u002B643b4e94@example.com reference DW9UNP\n\nYou can also find out further information of how Virgin Atlantic can assist here: https://help.virginatlantic.com/gb/en/special-assistance.html and you can also check if you have any medical conditions we may need to know a little more about here: https://help.virginatlantic.com/gb/en/special-assistance/medical-conditions.html.  \n\nShould you need any additional information or requests added please don\u2019t hesitate to let me know and I will be pleased to assist. \n\nKindest regards    \n\n\nNicola Davis\nAdvisor - Accessible Travel Services \nVirgin Atlantic",
          "displayName": "Nicola Davis",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-17T13:46:08",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~4",
          "noteId": 0
        }
      ],
