          "code": "Accessible Travel",
          "description": "Accessible Travel",
          "note": "If you have any medical requirements or need accessibility support during your \nstay, please email us at sanitized\u002B5930225f@example.com. \nThe Accessible Travel Services team can also help with any airport and onboard \nassistance you may have, more details are available here \nhttps://www.virginatlantic.com/en-US/help. \n\nIf you\u2019re travelling with an airline other than Virgin Atlantic, \nplease contact the operating airline directly to arrange the necessary assistance.",
